# ── Secrets / environment ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .env holds real local secrets on this machine and is git-ignored so
# nothing sensitive is ever committed. For deployment, copy the values into
# Vercel env vars instead of committing a .env file.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

